# Workspaces and paths

## Repository roots

Use the same **Documents** layout on **Windows** and **Mac** so `npm run sync:pull` finds both repos.

| Workspace | Windows | Mac |
|-----------|---------|-----|
| **Meet Map (main app)** | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\meetmap` | `~/Documents/meetmap` |
| **Meet Map Desktop (Vite root)** | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\meetmap-desktop\meetmap-desktop` | `~/Documents/meetmap-desktop/meetmap-desktop` |

Other Windows-only paths below live under **`C:\Users\areil\Documents\`** unless noted.

| Workspace | Absolute path |
|-----------|----------------|
| **Yard Sale app (yard sale map)** | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\yard-sale-map` |
| **Debate Arena** | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\debate-arena` |
| **Debate Arena v2** | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\debate-arena-v2` |
| **Car Meet App** (nested meetmap snapshot) | `C:\Users\areil\Documents\Car Meet App` |
