Assume all CLI commands (`npm`, `vercel`, `npx cap`) run from **`meetmap`** unless the task names another repo or desktop-only work.

## Yard Sale app

When the user mentions the **yard sale app**, **yard sale map**, **yard-sale-map**, or similar, they mean the project at **`C:\Users\areil\Documents\yard-sale-map`**, not `meetmap`. Use that folder for reads, edits, searches, and terminal commands for those tasks. If both apps are relevant, say which repo each change targets.

## Folder map (`meetmap`)

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
